      "references_and_reverse_links": "The 20 formal SOURCE_INDEX additions match the own-tier/wrapper, proc-gate, event-order, critical-roll, and actual action-route evidence at the pinned source SHA. The main and ranged blessing indexes and all five weapon-family reverse pages link the Headhunter entry and correct family-specific model/effect rows.",
